{"id":8690,"date":"2023-07-30T09:09:15","date_gmt":"2023-07-30T13:09:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=8690"},"modified":"2023-07-30T09:22:19","modified_gmt":"2023-07-30T13:22:19","slug":"we-made-it-to-the-light","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2023\/07\/30\/we-made-it-to-the-light\/","title":{"rendered":"We made it to the light!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Getting ready Friday morning to leave Campers Cove at Alpena and move a little west to Eckert Park at Hamlin, I received an email from Leonard at the lighthouse that we could just come ahead now rather than have to wait until Monday due to one of the couples working here had to leave due to a medical issue.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It was only a 45 minute drive and we were here and settled by about noon. There are three other rigs here (all motorhomes) and as the volunteers each came and went to\/from their lunch break they all stopped to introduce themselves and welcome us.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We continued to set up camp. We connected our electric, water, and sewer lines, took our e-bikes off the back of the car, set up our little Weber propane grill, brought out the bungee chairs and side tables, and rolled out the side awning.\u00a0 All this takes about a half hour and now we can sit and relax a bit! There was a nice breeze off the lake, but it was pretty warm and humid.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_080922-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8704\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_080922-1.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_080922-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_080922-1-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Our home in the trees for the next couple weeks<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>All four sites are nestled in the woods (lots of shade) and there&#8217;s a community fire pit with plenty of firewood, two large picnic tables, and a large propane BBQ grill.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Just beyond the fire pit there&#8217;s a trail going down to Lake Huron.&nbsp; Kathy and I took off our socks and shoes, put on other more appropriate footwear for trudging through the sand, and headed down to the water to check it out.&nbsp; Surprisingly, the water is warmer than I had imagined it would be this far north!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230728_181957.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8688\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230728_181957.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230728_181957-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230728_181957-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">See the freighter in the distance?<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Our supervisors Leonard and Carrie came by on their bicycles to greet us, they live just down U.S. 23 a bit and there&#8217;s a nice paved bike path alongside the road and the lake that goes all the way to Rogers City about 7 miles south.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Kathy and I ran into town for a bit to pick up a couple things.&nbsp; Shortly after we returned, the crew had finished their day (4:00pm) and we all settled at the picnic tables.&nbsp; Each of us had our favorite drink and we had the opportunity to get to know each other.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230728_172122.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8689\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230728_172122.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230728_172122-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230728_172122-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Our first nights supper with new friends<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>All of a sudden an instant pot showed up and we all shared a great time enjoying homemade vegetable beef soup and Texas toast.&nbsp; Ok, one side was a &#8220;little&#8221; overdone on the grill, but the other side was great \ud83d\ude03<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our first night backed up a couple hundred feet from the waves of Lake Huron was cool, breezy and SO comfortable we were lulled to sleep as soon as our heads hit the pillow.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Although we had visited the lighthouse last year, the next day we visited each venue to hear how the &#8220;pros&#8221; tell the story to visitors. Leonard had emailed us lots of info for us to study about the history, but it&#8217;s always good to see and hear how other docents share the story.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8702\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142723.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8702\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142723.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142723-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142723-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The fog horn building<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8701\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142929.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8701\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142929.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142929-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142929-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">A close up fog horn<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8700\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142821.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8700\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142821.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142821-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142821-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The pilot house from the freighter Calcite<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8699\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_143835.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8699\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_143835.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_143835-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_143835-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Inside the pilot house<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8698\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142443.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8698\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142443.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142443-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_142443-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Lighthouse apartments and light tower<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8697\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_141505.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8697\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_141505.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_141505-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/IMG_20230729_141505-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">View from the light<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"405\" height=\"540\" data-id=\"8696\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/img_20230729_1418124979629905430390836.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8696\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/img_20230729_1418124979629905430390836.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/img_20230729_1418124979629905430390836-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 405px) 100vw, 405px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Spiral staircase (53 steps)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>That&#8217;s the report for now.  Today we&#8217;ll take a drive into town to get some groceries, stop at one of the local produce stands, hit the laundromat and then when we get back we&#8217;ll visit the venues again to hear how others tell the story.  The volunteers rotate assignments each day so that each gets an opportunity to work everywhere.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In the meantime, be good and stay safe.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Getting ready Friday morning to leave Campers Cove at Alpena and move a little west to Eckert Park at Hamlin, I received an email from Leonard at the lighthouse that we could just come ahead now rather than have to wait until Monday due to one of the couples working here had to leave due &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2023\/07\/30\/we-made-it-to-the-light\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">We made it to the light!<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,586,677,554708025,19546,554708026,554707329,554707760,30025],"tags":[554708170,554708171,554707232,554708168,554708169,554707660,554708160,554708166,11110,554708167,3559,554707487,554707298],"class_list":["post-8690","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-food","category-friends","category-rving","category-sightseeing","category-touring","category-traveling","category-volunteering","category-working","tag-bike-path","tag-calcite","tag-camping","tag-docent","tag-herb-kathy","tag-herbsells","tag-lake-huron","tag-lighthouse","tag-michigan","tag-rogers-city","tag-rv",